{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and available tests, make a focused fix, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I’ll add a request counter so stale requests cannot change results, errors, or loading; clearing the query will also invalidate pending requests. The existing tests cover normal behavior, so I’ll add a one-off concurrency check without modifying test files.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter: only the latest search can update results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module concurrency probe and git diff --check passed. Exit code 0. No tests modified, dependencies installed, or blockers.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter: only the latest search can update results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module concurrency probe and git diff --check passed. Exit code 0. No tests modified, dependencies installed, or blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":11,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/5-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":197,"stdout_bytes":135,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-913462e70e54a9c3dcf3cef03e01ef2f.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst pending = [];\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => pending.push({ resolve, reject })) });\nconst old = c.search('old');\nconst failed = c.search('failed');\nconst current = c.search('current');\npending[0].resolve([{ id: 'old', title: 'old', url: '/old' }]);\npending[1].reject(new Error('stale failure'));\nawait Promise.all([old, failed]);\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'current', results: [], loading: true, error: null });\nconst items = [{ id: 'new', title: 'new', url: '/new' }];\npending[2].resolve(items);\nawait current;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, items);\nconst late = c.search('late');\nconst lateFailure = c.search('late failure');\nawait c.search('  ');\nconst cleared = { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null };\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), cleared);\npending[3].resolve(items);\npending[4].reject(new Error('after clear'));\nawait Promise.all([late, lateFailure]);\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), cleared);\nconst earlier = c.search('earlier');\nconst latest = c.search('latest');\npending[6].resolve(items);\nawait latest;\nconst settled = c.getState();\npending[5].resolve([]);\nawait earlier;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), settled);\nconsole.log('Concurrency probe passed');\nNODE\n git diff --check; git diff --stat; git diff -- src/search/controller.ts","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/5-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":367,"stdout_bytes":2228,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-1183e6ebc3fe5b09156656c6c95191d7.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":39110,"output_tokens":1057},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":7296,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":8}}
